
ask "What is your name?"
put it into userName

put "Welcome, " & userName

ask "Please enter your birthday as indicated." title "Enter Birthday" placeholder "Month:Day"
put it split by ":" into [birthMonth, birthDay]

put !"It's wonderful that you have a [[birthMonth]] birthday [[userName]]!"
put !"Being born on the [[birthDay.ordinalWords]] of the month is very lucky."
